// v5/airport: a phone (js/ui/props-phone.js): vAcc 24 the frame and back (dark anodised, a soft sheen), 25 the screen,
// lit: an app drawn from vC (x across 0..1, y down 0..1): the dark page, an ember header, a highlighted card and rows (the
